# 7. STACK BASICS

A simplified process memory layout:

```text
Higher Addresses
+----------------------+
|       Stack          |
+----------------------+
|        Heap          |
+----------------------+
|   Data / BSS         |
+----------------------+
|   Code / Text        |
+----------------------+
Lower Addresses
```

This is simplified; actual layouts vary by operating system, architecture, compiler and mitigations.

