The stack commonly contains information such as:

- Local variables
- Function arguments
- Saved execution state
- Stack frames

Example:

```text
+--------------------+
| Function data      |
+--------------------+
| Local buffer       |
+--------------------+
| Saved state        |
+--------------------+
| Return information |
+--------------------+
```

