```

This proves a potential vulnerability.

But exploitation may fail because of:

- ASLR
- DEP/NX
- Stack canary
- CFG
- CET
- Input restrictions
- Limited overwrite
- Incorrect offset
- Bad characters
- Application behavior

Therefore:

> **Vulnerability ≠ reliable exploit.**

