# ⭐ DAY 39 ONE-LINE EXAM ANSWER

> **Exploit development is the process of analyzing a vulnerability, creating controlled input to reproduce its behavior, determining what data or control flow can be influenced, accounting for security mitigations, and safely validating the resulting security impact.**

